<title>FRANCE: Parliament adopts report on environmental NGOs.</title>
<headline>Parliament adopts report on environmental NGOs.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG, France 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Parliament on Wednesday backed a European Commission proposal for an action programme to aid non-governmental organisations operating in the environmental sector.</p>
<p>It adopted the report by Austrian European People's Party deputy Paul Ruebig, which accepts the Commission's proposal that aid should amount to no more than 40 percent of budgeted expenditure.</p>
<p>Amendments accepted by the parliament were aimed at ensuring that the funds were used as efficiently as possible.</p>
</text>
